{1 Adapters and the Runtime}

This package is parameterized by {!module-type:Awskit.Runtime.S} — the pure
core does not perform IO. In practice:
{ul
  {li use [Awskit_s3_eio] for a ready-to-use direct-style Eio adapter}
  {li use [Awskit_s3_lwt] when you want a generic Lwt adapter over your own
      [Cohttp_lwt.S.Client] implementation}
  {li use [Awskit_s3_lwt_unix] when you want the ready-made Unix Lwt stack}
}

See {{:../awskit/guides.html}[aws Guides]} for transport/runtime details.

